
### Added - Wallet Backup & Restore (2025-11-02)

**Q) Secure Wallet Backup System - COMPLETE**

- **Backup Module** (`crates/wallet/src/backup.rs`)
  - AES-256-GCM encryption with separate backup password
  - HMAC-SHA256 tamper detection
  - Argon2id KDF (64 MiB memory cost)
  - Metadata preservation (version, network, timestamp, label)
  - Atomic file writes for safety

- **CLI Commands**
  - `wallet-backup` - Create encrypted backup
  - `wallet-restore` - Restore from backup
  - Interactive password prompts
  - Overwrite protection

- **Tests** (6/6 passing)
  - Round-trip backup/restore
  - Wrong password detection
  - Tamper detection
  - File save/load
  - Version checking
  - Metadata preservation

- **Documentation**
  - `docs/wallet/backup.md` - Complete usage guide
  - Best practices and security considerations
  - FAQ and troubleshooting

**Security Features:**
- Two-layer encryption (wallet + backup passwords)
- Stronger KDF than keystore (64 MiB vs 32 MiB)
- Cryptographic verification of integrity
- Version control for forward compatibility

